LocalPostshot private tile support, 2026.
The public gsplat 1.5.3 tensor layout, bounding rectangle and packed depth-key
interface were consulted, copyright the gsplat contributors, Apache License 2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/nerfstudio-project/gsplat
The kernels in this module were independently written and use NVIDIA CUB from
the installed CUDA SDK for stable radix sorting. Their recovered-algebra mode
is documented separately from the conservative mode and is not original code.
No original Postshot source, PTX, plugin, or binary is included or executed.
